DESCRIPTION:World Mental Health Day is marked on October 10 every year. It 
 was created in 1992 by the World Federation for Mental Health\, not by the
  World Health Organization\, though WHO has since become the day's largest
  amplifier. Its first incarnation was a two-hour television broadcast beam
 ed out of a studio in Tallahassee\, Florida\, to whichever countries could
  receive it.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/world-mental-health-da
